# Goes INSIDE the outer `handle { import authgate ... }` of the macro.stnmllr.com
# site block in /etc/caddy/Caddyfile — next to `handle /fisher/*`, BEFORE the
# inner catch-all `handle { root * /var/www/macro-dashboard ... }`.
#
# No `import authgate` here: the outer handle already runs it for every path in
# this site (that is how /fisher/ is gated too). Nested handle blocks are
# mutually exclusive and checked in written order — placed after the inner
# catch-all, this route would never be reached.
#
# `handle`, not `handle_path`: the prefix must reach the app, which resolves
# /deepdive/... via root_path (FISHERSCREEN_DEEPDIVE_UI_ROOT_PATH=/deepdive).
# `/deepdive*` also matches the bare /deepdive, which the app redirects to
# /deepdive/ — otherwise that address would fall through to the file server (404).

        handle /deepdive* {
            reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8765
        }
